        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG117/204, Contemporary Stainless Steel Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Square Leverset has a matching square rosette for a contemporary look. This stainless steel door lever features a concealed screw rose (no screws show) with self aligning spring assisted levers for a clean look. This ADA compliant leverset will fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG117-specifications.gif?v=1704354653\" width=\"452\" height=\"204\" border=\"0\" atl=\"AHI SIG117/204 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel AHI SIG117/204 Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG117 Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/16\" (135 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 3/4\" (20 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" (64 mm) squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG117-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG117 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Square Leverset",
                "description": "The Modern Square Leverset has a matching square rosette for a contemporary look. This stainless steel door lever features a concealed screw rose (no screws show) with self aligning spring assisted levers for a clean look. This ADA compliant leverset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
